  /* The mm_check_clk_change(0) call that used to sit here is REMOVED.
   *
   * Two defects: (a) grepping the whole authoritative tree finds NO
   * host-side caller of mm_check_clk_change -- we invented the call, so it
   * was a self-made divergence living inside a diagnostic; (b) it MUTATES
   * NXMAC LP-clock state at the exact moment we are trying to observe that
   * state, i.e. the probe was changing its own subject.
